  "ruleText": "Ncr 553.02 Notification. The director shall notify the public by public announcements and media postings of a proposed designation of quarantine identified pursuant to Ncr 553.01(a).\n\nSource. #14243, INTERIM, eff 4-23-25; ss by #14452 (formerly Ncr 5503.02), eff 12-6-25, EXPIRES 12-6-35",
